# Package Game cooks every content asset of the project, so the default project scene is enough (LeePerrySmith is
# cooked whether or not a scene places it).
# After PASS, in the scenario's editor.log: no "would not cook", no "SSRTrace.glslh" #error, no "[PackageCook] static
